cessor. For examples of Specialized Subprocessors, see the modifications sections of some ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"},", such as the ",{"tag":"a","children":["GD16-Series Pilot Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/GD16-Series_Pilot_Droid","referenceId":"reference:4265abbadb66408e"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
